{
  "key": "letter-150-part-01",
  "number": 150,
  "generationId": "01a1e6d7-209e-7e7e-b88e-cca35de186e0",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.668821
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "God is testing you every moment.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.071678,
      "end": 3.946939
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Laugh and take the test - it is beautiful that he considers you worth testing!",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.378821,
      "end": 10.258526
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "But don't be in a hurry for the more you hurry the more some goals recede, and without doubt the temple of God is a goal like that.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/04.mp3",
      "start": 11.984626,
      "end": 19.727347
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "He who travels with patience travels fastest on this journey.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/05.mp3",
      "start": 21.173469,
      "end": 24.599637
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "The mind will roam again and again - that is its way; the day its roaming stops it will be dead.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/06.mp3",
      "start": 25.970136,
      "end": 32.081224
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Sometimes it sleeps - do not mistake this for death.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/07.mp3",
      "start": 33.416689000000005,
      "end": 37.074875
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Sometimes it gets tired - don't mistake this for death either.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/08.mp3",
      "start": 38.289297000000005,
      "end": 42.151247
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Some rest and sleep and it is strong and alive again.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/09.mp3",
      "start": 43.634240000000005,
      "end": 47.745146999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "So stop bothering about it altogether for even this worry gives it strength.",
      "path": "audio/1970-150/10.mp3",
      "start": 49.298753000000005,
      "end": 54.28
    }
  ]
}
